    # B03's taller 0.92 m task table already sits close to the right-hand home
    # pose.  A +14.9 mm randomized lift reproducibly moves that TCP by 6.2 mm
    # during reset, while <=10 mm retains clearance.  Keep height randomized
    # inside the verified band; peg/socket XY and yaw ranges are unchanged.
